# GalaxyXR-Driver

Read `AGENTS.md` first; it is the canonical project contract. This file only supplies Cursor mechanics.

- Source roots: `GalaxyXRDriver/` (C++17) and `GalaxyXRDriverGUI/` (TypeScript/Lit + Tauri). `GalaxyXRNative` is the vendor runtime identity; `CustomHeadsetOpenVR` is neutral.
- Generated output: `../builds/GalaxyXR-Driver/` only.
- End-of-plan gate: `tools/Build-Portable.ps1`. Focused checks: `npm test`, `npm run build:ui`, `tools/Test-*.ps1`, `tools/Test-*.cjs`, `cargo test --locked --lib`.
- Preserve settings schemas, migrations, defaults, installer rollback, SteamVR journal ownership and both vendor/legacy paths. Never edit `ThirdParty/`.
- Commit, push, deploy, SteamVR/ADB actions, release and workflow dispatch need explicit authorization.
- Skills: `@galaxyxr-workspace` for the map, `@customheadset-gxr` for implementation, `@cavecrew` for delegation. Canonical copies live under `.opencode/skills/`.
